    "summary": "Fixed the never-throws finding: the catch in teamGate now builds its message with errorText, which handles an Error, a string and any other value (null, undefined, numbers, objects), so a policy reader or port that throws a non-Error cannot make the handler itself throw. The fourth test now throws null, undefined, a string, a number and an object from the policy reader and asserts each gives a refused outcome (and the string case keeps its text).",
